    "name": "What Affects the Cost of a Bedroom Addition in San Diego and Chula Vista?",
    "text": "What Affects the Cost of a Bedroom Addition in San Diego and Chula Vista?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "The cost of a bedroom addition depends on the room’s size, foundation and framing needs, roof connection, windows and doors, electrical and heating or cooling work, finish selections, site access, and whether plumbing is added for an attached bathroom. A dependable estimate requires a property review and defined design scope rather than a price based only on square footage.",
